<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India up in June.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India up in June.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silver re-exports from Dubai to India rose to 111.1 tonnes in June from 70.2 tonnes the previous month, according to the statistics section of Dubai customs.</p>
<p>India is the largest importer of silver from the Gulf Arab trading emirate.</p>
</text>
